<title>UK: INTERVIEW-Hicksons expects to reduce debt.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-Hicksons expects to reduce debt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British speciality chemicals firm Hicksons International Plc expects to reduce its debt by at least 25 million stg in 1997 from 56.4 million stg as it stood at December 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Our target is at least 25 million and we are confident we should do it,&quot; Justin Court, Hickson's group finance director told Reuters in an interview.</p>
</text>
